    <string name="rules_title">Rules</string>
    <string name="welcome_title">Welcome to Abalone</string>
    <string name="rules_1">Goal: push the other side’s marbles off the board. First to push off 6 wins.</string>
    <string name="rules_2">Each turn, move 1 to 3 of your marbles that sit in a line: slide the line one step forward, or shift the whole row sideways one step.</string>
    <string name="rules_3">Forward into the enemy? If your line is longer than theirs, you push them along (3 vs 2, 3 vs 1, 2 vs 1). Same length won’t budge. Sideways never pushes.</string>
    <string name="rules_4">A marble pushed over the rim drops into the gutter and stays there.</string>
    <string name="rules_mistakes">Common slips</string>
    <string name="mistake_1">Don’t rush to the rim. Marbles on the edge are the easy ones to push off. Crowd the middle first.</string>
    <string name="mistake_2">Tapped three and no arrows lit? They’re not in a line. Touching, same direction, that’s a line.</string>
    <string name="mistake_3">Can’t push? It’s not a bug: they match your number, or there’s one more behind them. Try another direction, or bring friends.</string>
    <string name="rules_source">Rules follow the official 1990 Abalone rules. Draws (same position three times / 120 moves with no marble off) are this app’s own rule.</string>
